  "details": "1. Create a new world. Have some data in it so it takes a moment.\n\n2. Prepare to upload. Choose a name etc, and pick an icon.\n\n3. Hit build & publish, and accept the dialog\n\n4. While it is building, delete or move the image\n\nAfter telling you the error, the SDK will not recover, and requires a unity restart to fix it.\n\nThis occurs on SDK 3.8.1",
